{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Darkness Falls Again \u2014 The Return of \u201cAbyss Night\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centuries ago, the skies turned crimson and monsters poured into the world. That night, the world was nearly consumed by a force known as the \u201cAbyss.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, the catastrophe once sealed away by legendary heroes has returned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect the Crystal. Darkness once again blankets the land, and each night, stronger monsters surge forth through dimensional rifts.     </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Strategic Defense + Resource Gathering</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest plants and collect Gold to strengthen your units. You won\u2019t survive by defending alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Classic RTS-Style Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select units and issue commands in real-time. Intuitive A-click attack move and right-click pathing system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Diverse Unit Combinations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy six distinct unit types \u2014 Warrior, Wizard, Tanker, Berserker, Fire Wizard, and Ironshield \u2014 to build your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Progressively Stronger Night Waves</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger each day to survive the increasingly powerful enemy waves that come with every nightfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Pixel Art Aesthetic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a handcrafted medieval fantasy world brought to life through detailed pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3823340?t=1751508694","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3823340?t=1751508694","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823340/589cff3d37bcedb20f31672e8b3ca304956f2620/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751508694","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823340/589cff3d37bcedb20f31672e8b3ca304956f2620/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751508694","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Darkness Falls Again \u2014 The Return of \u201cAbyss Night\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centuries ago, the skies turned crimson and monsters poured into the world. That night, the world was nearly consumed by a force known as the \u201cAbyss.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, the catastrophe once sealed away by legendary heroes has returned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect the Crystal. Darkness once again blankets the land, and each night, stronger monsters surge forth through dimensional rifts.     </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Strategic Defense + Resource Gathering</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest plants and collect Gold to strengthen your units. You won\u2019t survive by defending alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Classic RTS-Style Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select units and issue commands in real-time. Intuitive A-click attack move and right-click pathing system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragr